# The mayor's morning walk, run with @spec as mobile_update would, with the clock at 6 in the morning and only
# area_update running (so the hour stays 6). The mayor (3143) starts asleep in his room (3138), where Smokegod
# (60) waits; Cherub (52) follows the mayor round town.
# - the 52 steps of the open path: he wakes, walks, says his lines, opens the gates, comes home and goes back to
#   sleep (another mayor, from the area's reset, sleeps there too)
# - it's still 6, so the next call starts him on it again
@clock 1763399520
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3138
holylight
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@as god
transfer cherub 3138
@mob 3143 3138
@as cher
follow mayor
@as god
@spec 52
@as cher
look
@state
@as god
@spec 2
look
@state
